# JSON-LD

- Use `@graph` with stable `@id` anchors in `RegionalLayout`
- One `Organization` site-wide; regional `WebPage` with `inLanguage` per page
- `url` and `@id` must match canonical URL
- `inLanguage` from `regions.ts` hreflang (e.g. `en-AU`)
- Do not duplicate `Organization` blocks per region
- Use `JsonLd.astro` component for rendering
